      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Redbird%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Red Bird Investment Company marketed land in the area specifically to Black investors and farmers around 1900.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
