      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/redbird_oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "More than 600 people attended the official opening of Redbird on August 10, 1907.",
